{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n  <body>\n    <p>每一次的出差或旅行，是否總讓您因為擔心遺漏物品而感到焦躁不安呢？《ToPack》這款高效的行李收拾助手，正是為了解決您的煩惱而設計。它能幫助您輕鬆管理每次旅程的打包清單，確保您不再錯過任何重要物品，讓出行前的壓力瞬間減輕。現在這款實用的 App 限時免費中，正是您告別旅程前手忙腳亂的最佳時機，趕緊下載體驗吧！</p>\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/460x460bb-75-39.webp\" alt=\"限時免費\">\n    <h2>個人化清單隨心訂製</h2>\n    <p>《ToPack》提供多項貼心功能，讓您能依照個人獨特需求，自由訂製旅行清單的類別與項目，實現清單的完全個人化。無論是家庭旅遊、商務出差還是戶外探險，都能建立專屬的收納方案。更便利的是，它支援 CSV 及其他格式的匯入與匯出功能，讓清單管理流程更加靈活，大幅提升資料運用的彈性與效率。</p>\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-65-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-66-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-67-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-68-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-69-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-70-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <ul>\n      <li>應用名稱：ToPack》出行收拾行李助手</li>\n      <li>應用類別：Travel</li>\n      <li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n    </ul>\n  </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-08T09:43:43.804021+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":355,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}